pt authority. No other security defect found.\n\nSimplification: one detector, two fields, and one merge-mode flag remain the smallest coherent shape. The repair should define one seal-only incorporation protocol and one explicit fold association to the approval's reporting artifact, not add another lifecycle, content-equality engine, or second reconciliation command.\n\nVerification: make docs passed; git diff --check passed; worktree clean; HEAD and origin branch equal 2e1ab348; the candidate is one commit on exact main 79e84008 and changes only the 406-line note. The historical 30768e3f diff and representative current citations were reproduced, including Landings limit/ordering, /v0/landed, spine and Thread landing reads, the already-contained refusal, receipt validator/mergedArtifacts, completion precedence, WorkPageDefault, merge lock, and merge refusal table.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:20d262776da1269ef85c3882bbe151661defe6c0","head":"2e1ab348855da4d85a3b42da439701810f8c35eb","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:71ba7e2d12d6d28f9504847aa069eeb99031f650\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:ec0b2afd73f1a40dc3c439eca56c6aa31459685a","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"changes-requested"}}